ptember 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-02000-3 An organic polymer with a large refractive index and excellent transparency in the infrared regime could bring new opportunities for imaging.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">1cf68b59a027</guid><pubDate>2026-09-15T09:18:46.554469+00:00</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>新思科技获准向是德科技出售光学解决方案部门</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/212/a1298390.html</link><description>新思科技（Synopsys）宣布已获得所有相关监管机构的最终批准，将正式推进此前已公布的业务剥离计划：将旗下光学解决方案部门（Optical Solutions Group）及 PowerArtist 业务出售给是德科技（Keysight）。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">5db61d7aaa75</guid><pubDate>2026-09-15T09:18:46.554469+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_IT资讯</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>A milestone toward exawatt plasma optics by Raman amplification</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41566-026-01989-x</link><description>Nature Photonics, Published online: 28 August 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-01989-x Exawatt-to-zettawatt lasers are essential in the quest for an ultimate understanding of nature, but they are held back by the damage limits of conventional optics. A recent experiment of Raman pulse compression to terawatt power revitalizes the prospect of plasma-based optics for next-generation ultraintense lasers.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e9d1bba751e5</guid><pubDate>2026-09-15T09:18:46.554469+00:00</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>展商回顾 | 同济大学精密光学工程技术研究所精彩亮相，前沿光学科技成果备受瞩目</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2665_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">97138dbe3744</guid><pubDate>2026-09-15T09:18:46.554469+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>展商回顾 | 复享光学携新品膜厚测量仪亮相，引领光谱技术发展</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2663_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">a38de14953cd</guid><pubDate>2026-09-15T09: